      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOMMY KNUCKLES (8) missed the frame last time at this track but was a Grade 6 winner the start prior (19.22) and goes well this journey. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. NINA SIYAN (6) was well supported last time but could only manage second (19.15), beaten one length. Expected to be in this for a long way. MAJESTIC ETHICS (1) is suited by the inside draw. Last start finished last in a Grade 5 on August 10 over 300m at this track behind Zabdon No Doubt beaten 5.5 lengths (17.12). With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. GYPSY GIRL PEARL (2) deserves plenty of thought over this trip.",
